Package: @NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv
Maintainer: ECRT project <ecrt@localhost>
Description: ECRT Raspberry Pi dashboard
 Streamlit dashboard for the ECRT energy monitor. Reads the Arduino Uno over
 USB serial, or a built-in mock feed. Installs into its own virtualenv and
 needs network access to PyPI when the package is configured.
